<font size="64">- We ate well. - Yes.</font>

2337
00:58:09,060 --> 00:58:10,930
<font size="64">- Pick one person to pay? - Yes.</font>

2338
00:58:10,890 --> 00:58:14,160
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Meticulous)</font>

2339
00:58:10,930 --> 00:58:13,190
<font size="64">You must include that you're filming Running Man.</font>

2340
00:58:13,190 --> 00:58:15,300
<font size="64">I'm filming Running Man.</font>

2341
00:58:15,960 --> 00:58:19,600
<font size="64">Good luck filming. I hope you make others laugh.</font>

2342
00:58:19,700 --> 00:58:22,970
<font size="64">What I want to talk about is that we just had lunch.</font>

2343
00:58:19,800 --> 00:58:22,300
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(As Jong Kook said, it seems he's built quite a rapport with the AI.)</font>

2344
00:58:22,970 --> 00:58:24,370
<font size="64">We had Chinese food.</font>

2345
00:58:24,510 --> 00:58:25,810
<font size="64">Did you enjoy it?</font>

2346
00:58:25,810 --> 00:58:28,680
<font size="64">I wonder if there's a bet as to who will pay.</font>

2347
00:58:28,680 --> 00:58:30,550
<font size="64">- It caught on. - It's serious.</font>

2348
00:58:29,580 --> 00:58:32,380
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jae Seok's AI is quick-witted.)</font>

2349
00:58:30,680 --> 00:58:32,980
<font size="64">Someone has to pay for the food.</font>

2350
00:58:32,380 --> 00:58:34,420
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The point)</font>

2351
00:58:32,980 --> 00:58:34,150
<font size="64">It wouldn't be me.</font>

2352
00:58:34,150 --> 00:58:37,390
<font size="64">No Running Man meal is complete without a bet.</font>

2353
00:58:37,390 --> 00:58:40,620
<font size="64">What mission or game will you play to decide who pays?</font>

2354
00:58:40,620 --> 00:58:43,520
<font size="64">It's simple. I'll give you...</font>

2355
00:58:41,590 --> 00:58:49,460
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(AI's choice: Choose one person whose name gives you a feeling.)</font>

2356
00:58:43,730 --> 00:58:46,390
<font size="64">the names of everyone who is on today.</font>

2357
00:58:46,390 --> 00:58:49,460
<font size="64">Pick one person who you want to pay.</font>

2358
00:58:49,460 --> 00:58:50,600
<font size="64">Okay, then.</font>

2359
00:58:51,200 --> 00:58:54,970
<font size="64">Haha, Heo Kyeong Hwan, Ji Ye Eun,</font>

2360
00:58:55,200 --> 00:58:58,910
<font size="64">Jee Seok Jin, Song Ji Hyo, Lee Ju Yeon,</font>

2361
00:58:59,510 --> 00:59:03,240
<font size="64">MIYEON, Se Chan, Jong Kook, Jae Seok.</font>

2362
00:59:03,240 --> 00:59:05,610
<font size="64">There are nine of us.</font>

2363
00:59:05,680 --> 00:59:09,080
<font size="64">It's clean and simple. Pick one person whom you think...</font>

2364
00:59:06,350 --> 00:59:10,150
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Who will AI pick to pay?)</font>

2365
00:59:09,080 --> 00:59:10,220
<font size="64">should pay for lunch.</font>

2366
00:59:10,320 --> 00:59:12,320
<font size="64">The person to pay for lunch today...</font>

2367
00:59:12,320 --> 00:59:14,190
<font size="64">The person to pay for lunch today...</font>

2368
00:59:15,220 --> 00:59:16,620
<font size="64">is Haha.</font>

2369
00:59:17,430 --> 00:59:20,500
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Haha is chosen.)</font>

2370
00:59:17,530 --> 00:59:18,860
<font size="64">is Haha.</font>

2371
00:59:21,830 --> 00:59:23,030
<font size="64">What's wrong?</font>

2372
00:59:22,000 --> 00:59:23,770
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(What's the reason?)</font>

2373
00:59:23,100 --> 00:59:24,700
<font size="64">Why did you choose him?</font>

2374
00:59:24,700 --> 00:59:27,670
<font size="64">Chinese food makes everyone happy and full of energy.</font>

2375
00:59:27,700 --> 00:59:30,910
<font size="64">I chose him because I think he would've been the most talkative.</font>

2376
00:59:30,910 --> 00:59:32,040
<font size="64">He didn't even eat.</font>

2377
00:59:32,310 --> 00:59:35,680
<font size="64">Thanks, but just so you know, Haha didn't even get to eat.</font>

2378
00:59:35,680 --> 00:59:37,350
<font size="64">- It's fun that way. - It's Haha, right?</font>

2379
00:59:37,410 --> 00:59:40,850
<font size="64">It's more fun and unfair when the one who didn't eat pays.</font>

2380
00:59:40,850 --> 00:59:42,820
<font size="64">Thank you. Bye.</font>

2381
00:59:41,780 --> 00:59:44,550
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(AI knows how to be entertaining just like Jae Seok.)</font>

2382
00:59:42,820 --> 00:59:44,890
<font size="64">That's incredible.</font>

2383
00:59:44,920 --> 00:59:46,350
<font size="64">- It's you. - Hang on.</font>

2384
00:59:46,690 --> 00:59:49,090
<font size="64">You said "Se Chan," not "Yang Se Chan."</font>

2385
00:59:49,090 --> 00:59:51,090
<font size="64">You skipped the family names of some people.</font>

2386
00:59:51,090 --> 00:59:52,360
<font size="64">- Yours too. - You too.</font>

2387
00:59:52,360 --> 00:59:54,300
<font size="64">- He didn't say Ha Dong Hoon. - Right.</font>

2388
00:59:54,300 --> 00:59:55,830
<font size="64">You should've said "Dong Hoon."</font>

2389
00:59:54,430 --> 00:59:56,500
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(It's unfair.)</font>

2390
00:59:55,830 --> 00:59:57,470
<font size="64">- It's too late. - It's not about that.</font>

2391
00:59:57,470 --> 01:00:00,200
<font size="64">- Right. - It is about that.</font>

2392
01:00:00,200 --> 01:00:04,040
<font size="64">Haha, you must pay because AI chose you.</font>

2393
01:00:01,540 --> 01:00:03,740
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(It's 320 dollars in total.)</font>

2394
01:00:03,940 --> 01:00:06,840
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Haha, who couldn't even get to eat, has to pay for lunch.)</font>

2395
01:00:04,210 --> 01:00:05,840
<font size="64">- You spend a lot these days. - Thanks for the meal.</font>

2396
01:00:05,840 --> 01:00:07,780
<font size="64">- Gosh. - I enjoyed that.</font>

2397
01:00:07,040 --> 01:00:09,480
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Moving on to the next spot)</font>

2398
01:00:07,780 --> 01:00:09,780
<font size="64">- Shall we go? - That was a lovely meal.</font>

2399
01:00:09,780 --> 01:00:12,110
<font size="64">- Kyeong Hwan's here today... - Yes.</font>

2400
01:00:12,110 --> 01:00:14,050
<font size="64">because "Best Peak" ended.</font>

2401
01:00:14,050 --> 01:00:16,420
<font size="64">- Yes. - Oh, that ended.</font>

2402
01:00:14,520 --> 01:00:17,820
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Kyeong Hwan came to the show after another show had ended.)</font>

2403
01:00:16,420 --> 01:00:17,590
<font size="64">I came on right away.</font>

2404
01:00:17,590 --> 01:00:22,920
<font size="64">Kyeong Hwan was able to join "Hangout With Yoo" because...</font>

2405
01:00:22,920 --> 01:00:24,530
<font size="64">- he was on Running Man. - Yes.</font>

2406
01:00:24,530 --> 01:00:28,030
<font size="64">I was in Hongdae recently, filming something for YouTube.</font>

2407
01:00:28,200 --> 01:00:30,970
<font size="64">Foreigners pointed and said they knew me.</font>

2408
01:00:29,230 --> 01:00:32,100
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Foreigners recognized him.)</font>

2409
01:00:30,970 --> 01:00:34,300
<font size="64">I asked how they knew me, and they said they saw Running Man.</font>

2410
01:00:34,300 --> 01:00:37,540
<font size="64">I asked how they knew me when I'm only on once a year.</font>

2411
01:00:36,040 --> 01:00:38,440
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Thankfully, they remembered him...)</font>

2412
01:00:37,540 --> 01:00:39,110
<font size="64">They knew that too.</font>

2413
01:00:38,440 --> 01:00:40,780
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(despite his once-a-year appearances on Running Man.)</font>

2414
01:00:39,110 --> 01:00:40,510
<font size="64">- Gosh. - That's crazy.</font>

2415
01:00:40,510 --> 01:00:42,040
<font size="64">- In my case... - It was so surreal.</font>

2416
01:00:42,040 --> 01:00:44,650
<font size="64">I was filming "Hangout with Yoo" recently.</font>

2417
01:00:44,650 --> 01:00:46,780
<font size="64">I met a kid in the street.</font>

2418
01:00:46,780 --> 01:00:48,550
<font size="64">- It was last week. - What happened?</font>

2419
01:00:48,550 --> 01:00:50,850
<font size="64">- He didn't know Haha. - That's right.</font>

2420
01:00:50,850 --> 01:00:52,820
<font size="64">- Every week, Haha... - That can't be.</font>

2421
01:00:52,820 --> 01:00:55,490
<font size="64">They even said they grew up watching Running Man.</font>

2422
01:00:55,490 --> 01:00:56,690
<font size="64">Why don't they know you, then?</font>

2423
01:00:56,690 --> 01:00:57,690
<font size="64">Don't lie.</font>

2424
01:00:57,690 --> 01:00:59,030
<font size="64">- It's true. - I swear.</font>

2425
01:00:59,030 --> 01:01:00,530
<font size="64">- They don't know you? - It was on TV.</font>

2426
01:00:59,130 --> 01:01:00,900
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A shocking story about Haha...)</font>

2427
01:01:00,530 --> 01:01:02,100
<font size="64">- They didn't recognize you? - I...</font>

2428
01:01:00,900 --> 01:01:02,660
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(who always talked about "Running Man kids")</font>

2429
01:01:02,100 --> 01:01:03,200
<font size="64">Does that make sense?</font>

2430
01:01:03,200 --> 01:01:05,300
<font size="64">I asked if they liked Running Man, and they said they loved it.</font>

2431
01:01:05,300 --> 01:01:07,600
<font size="64">"Do you know Yu Jae Seok?" "Yes."</font>

2432
01:01:07,600 --> 01:01:09,940
<font size="64">"Do you know me?" "No."</font>

2433
01:01:09,940 --> 01:01:11,370
<font size="64">- What? - Does that make sense?</font>

2434
01:01:11,370 --> 01:01:14,340
<font size="64">They watch Running Man, know Jae Seok, but not me?</font>

2435
01:01:11,810 --> 01:01:14,740
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Haha, who has been on Running Man for 16 consecutive years)</font>

2436
01:01:14,540 --> 01:01:15,710
<font size="64">It makes zero sense.</font>

2437
01:01:15,410 --> 01:01:17,510
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Laughing incredulously)</font>

2438
01:01:18,280 --> 01:01:20,010
<font size="64">It was just a kid who loved Jae Seok.</font>

2439
01:01:20,010 --> 01:01:21,320
<font size="64">- Still... - They saw "Infinite Challenge."</font>

2440
01:01:21,320 --> 01:01:22,920
<font size="64">- The kid... - I did "Infinite Challenge" too.</font>

2441
01:01:22,920 --> 01:01:23,950
<font size="64">Oh, right.</font>

2442
01:01:24,420 --> 01:01:26,920
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Haha, appeared on "Infinite Challenge" for 12 years)</font>

2443
01:01:24,920 --> 01:01:27,290
<font size="64">- Nice one, Ye Eun. - That was funny.</font>

2444
01:01:27,290 --> 01:01:29,320
<font size="64">- You hurt him yet again. - Ye Eun.</font>

2445
01:01:29,390 --> 01:01:31,090
<font size="64">- I forgot. - Ye Eun.</font>

2446
01:01:31,090 --> 01:01:32,930
<font size="64">- Don't hurt him again. - "Infinite Challenge"...</font>

2447
01:01:31,130 --> 01:01:33,430
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Gibberish)</font>

2448
01:01:32,930 --> 01:01:35,800
<font size="64">- That was a great joke. - Ye Eun.</font>

2449
01:01:33,930 --> 01:01:36,500
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Bitter)</font>

2450
01:01:36,900 --> 01:01:39,170
<font size="64">- Ye Eun. Teach Ji Hyo how to dance. - Yes?</font>

2451
01:01:39,170 --> 01:01:40,200
<font size="64">I should.</font>

2452
01:01:40,200 --> 01:01:42,770
<font size="64">Teach Ju Yeon too. She can't dance either.</font>

2453
01:01:42,770 --> 01:01:44,210
<font size="64">Me? Why me?</font>

2454
01:01:44,210 --> 01:01:47,410
<font size="64">She was in After School, known for their crazy hard choreo.</font>

2455
01:01:47,410 --> 01:01:48,840
<font size="64">Do you see how incredible I am now?</font>

2456
01:01:47,610 --> 01:01:50,810
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(I couldn't dance, but I still did it.)</font>

2457
01:01:48,840 --> 01:01:50,810
<font size="64">- You worked really hard. - I did.</font>

2458
01:01:50,850 --> 01:01:52,410
<font size="64">After School's moves are tough.</font>

2459
01:01:51,710 --> 01:01:52,910
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(After School was a performance group...)</font>

2460
01:01:52,410 --> 01:01:53,410
<font size="64">Everything's timed exactly.</font>

2461
01:01:52,910 --> 01:01:54,120
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(known for its extremely demanding choreography.)</font>

2462
01:01:53,410 --> 01:01:54,820
<font size="64">- The performances. We banged drums. - "Bang!"</font>

2463
01:01:54,820 --> 01:01:56,220
<font size="64">- Right. - Yes.</font>

2464
01:01:56,250 --> 01:01:59,290
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Drum performance)</font>

2465
01:01:59,620 --> 01:02:01,390
<font size="64">We tap-danced.</font>

2466
01:01:59,820 --> 01:02:03,190
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Synchronized tap-dance)</font>

2467
01:02:03,490 --> 01:02:05,160
<font size="64">We even learned pole dancing.</font>

2468
01:02:03,660 --> 01:02:06,130
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Pole dancing while singing)</font>

2469
01:02:05,160 --> 01:02:06,690
<font size="64">How did you do that?</font>

2470
01:02:06,130 --> 01:02:07,360
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Nervous)</font>

2471
01:02:07,300 --> 01:02:09,160
<font size="64">I put my life on the line.</font>

2472
01:02:09,160 --> 01:02:11,200
<font size="64">- That's crazy. - It was all hard work.</font>

2473
01:02:09,530 --> 01:02:12,930
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(That's why people always looked forward to their performance.)</font>

2474
01:02:11,200 --> 01:02:14,970
<font size="64">How many years were you a member of After School for?</font>

2475
01:02:14,970 --> 01:02:16,270
<font size="64">Six years.</font>

2476
01:02:16,270 --> 01:02:18,010
<font size="64">- After six years... - That's it?</font>

2477
01:02:18,010 --> 01:02:20,780
<font size="64">- That's why she left soon. - What?</font>

2478
01:02:20,780 --> 01:02:23,340
<font size="64">- Are you talking to yourself? - I was on the phone.</font>

2479
01:02:22,280 --> 01:02:24,410
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Embarrassed)</font>

2480
01:02:23,910 --> 01:02:25,380
<font size="64">After all that...</font>

2481
01:02:25,380 --> 01:02:29,680
<font size="64">I'm the only member who was there from the beginning to the end.</font>

2482
01:02:27,150 --> 01:02:30,890
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(I stayed with After School from the beginning to the end.)</font>

2483
01:02:29,950 --> 01:02:31,250
<font size="64">- Only I did that. - Really?</font>

2484
01:02:32,290 --> 01:02:33,690
<font size="64">I thought Kahi stayed with the team from the beginning to the end.</font>

2485
01:02:33,690 --> 01:02:35,420
<font size="64">- At the very end, - That's right.</font>

2486
01:02:35,420 --> 01:02:38,690
<font size="64">Kahi dumped the pole dance on us and left the team.</font>

2487
01:02:37,060 --> 01:02:38,830
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Kahi dumped the pole dance on us and left the team.)</font>

2488
01:02:38,990 --> 01:02:41,600
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(She gave them a big challenge.)</font>

2489
01:02:39,260 --> 01:02:40,960
<font size="64">- She dumped the performance... - I see.</font>

2490
01:02:40,960 --> 01:02:42,260
<font size="64">- on us. - She dumped it on you guys.</font>

2491
01:02:42,260 --> 01:02:45,900
<font size="64">We got bruised like crazy from pole dancing.</font>

2492
01:02:45,970 --> 01:02:47,440
<font size="64">We had to wear skimpy clothes...</font>

2493
01:02:47,440 --> 01:02:49,600
<font size="64">- in winter. - Pole dancing is hard.</font>

2494
01:02:49,770 --> 01:02:50,840
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Glancing)</font>

2495
01:02:49,900 --> 01:02:51,870
<font size="64">- You even did pole dancing. - Yes.</font>

2496
01:02:50,840 --> 01:02:52,210
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Chuckling)</font>

2497
01:02:52,010 --> 01:02:53,170
<font size="64">- When we did tap dancing... - Kyeong Hwan...</font>

2498
01:02:53,170 --> 01:02:54,610
<font size="64">keeps talking to himself. What am I supposed to do?</font>

2499
01:02:54,610 --> 01:02:57,040
<font size="64">- He always does that. - No.</font>

2500
01:02:54,680 --> 01:02:57,280
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Let him be.)</font>

2501
01:02:57,150 --> 01:02:59,380
<font size="64">I was just showing my reactions.</font>

2502
01:02:59,650 --> 01:03:01,120
<font size="64">- I didn't know you were there. - This is uncomfortable.</font>

2503
01:03:01,120 --> 01:03:02,620
<font size="64">What? What was that?</font>

2504
01:03:03,020 --> 01:03:04,420
<font size="64">- This happened last time too. - I didn't know he was there.</font>

2505
01:03:03,180 --> 01:03:05,720
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Making sure to attack him)</font>

2506
01:03:05,120 --> 01:03:06,150
<font size="64">You didn't know he was there?</font>

2507
01:03:06,150 --> 01:03:07,790
<font size="64">- I couldn't see him. - Everyone can get off.</font>

2508
01:03:06,690 --> 01:03:08,820
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Innocent)</font>

2509
01:03:07,790 --> 01:03:08,820
<font size="64">He is in my blind spot.</font>

2510
01:03:08,820 --> 01:03:10,320
<font size="64">Everyone can get off.</font>

2511
01:03:10,320 --> 01:03:11,860
<font size="64">I'll go with the driver.</font>

2512
01:03:11,960 --> 01:03:13,790
<font size="64">Please drop me off nearby.</font>

2513
01:03:13,860 --> 01:03:15,630
<font size="64">I think I can walk home from here.</font>

2514
01:03:15,630 --> 01:03:17,630
<font size="64">- Don't be like that. - Let's go.</font>

2515
01:03:15,900 --> 01:03:19,070
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Fortunately, they arrived at the next spot before he got off.)</font>

2516
01:03:17,670 --> 01:03:19,100
<font size="64">- We're here. - We're finally here.</font>

2517
01:03:19,230 --> 01:03:20,770
<font size="64">Let's go.</font>

2518
01:03:20,770 --> 01:03:22,700
<font size="64">- This is... What's this? - What's this?</font>

2519
01:03:21,840 --> 01:03:24,970
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The monitors and laptops are sitting there in plain sight.)</font>

2520
01:03:22,700 --> 01:03:24,610
<font size="64">- What's this? - There are laptops.</font>

2521
01:03:24,610 --> 01:03:25,740
<font size="64">I know what it is.</font>

2522
01:03:25,740 --> 01:03:27,180
<font size="64">It's the segment we had in the past.</font>

2523
01:03:27,310 --> 01:03:29,110
<font size="64">- My favorite segment. - Se Chan...</font>

2524
01:03:29,110 --> 01:03:30,550
<font size="64">- and I've done this. - It's fun.</font>

2525
01:03:30,550 --> 01:03:32,150
<font size="64">- Kyeong Hwan and Se Chan. - Kyeong Hwan.</font>

2526
01:03:32,150 --> 01:03:34,120
<font size="64">- Kyeong Hwan, today is your day. - It's fun.</font>

2527
01:03:34,120 --> 01:03:35,680
<font size="64">Shouldn't MIYEON sit there?</font>

2528
01:03:34,580 --> 01:03:37,420
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(If it's a quiz)</font>

