<font size="64">- Okay. - Thank you for your hard work.</font>

3693
01:31:16,410 --> 01:31:18,310
<font size="64">- Seok Jin is so funny. - It's hilarious.</font>

3694
01:31:16,880 --> 01:31:18,710
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(We'd like to thank Ju Yeon, Kyeong Hwan, and MIYEON.)</font>

3695
01:31:18,310 --> 01:31:20,380
<font size="64">- Thank you. - Thank you.</font>

3696
01:31:18,710 --> 01:31:20,580
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(for their appearance today.)</font>

3697
01:31:20,950 --> 01:31:23,450
<font size="64">This is the Running Kingdom.</font>

3698
01:31:20,980 --> 01:31:23,880
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Three grand dukes ruled over the Running Kingdom.)</font>

3699
01:31:23,450 --> 01:31:25,720
<font size="64">"Maebe Aewoo..."</font>

3700
01:31:23,950 --> 01:31:25,590
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The Grand Duke of Fools, Haha)</font>

3701
01:31:25,950 --> 01:31:28,090
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The Grand Duke of Belly Fat, Yang Se Chan)</font>

3702
01:31:25,990 --> 01:31:28,220
<font size="64">That was one good meal. I love it.</font>

3703
01:31:28,220 --> 01:31:29,990
<font size="64">The real deal is coming. What do we do?</font>

3704
01:31:28,860 --> 01:31:31,420
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(And the real Grand Duke is making an out-of-this-world entrance.)</font>

3705
01:31:29,990 --> 01:31:31,590
<font size="64">- The real deal. - San is coming.</font>

3706
01:31:31,490 --> 01:31:32,730
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A visual straight out of a comic book)</font>

3707
01:31:32,690 --> 01:31:34,290
<font size="64">If it's what you desire,</font>

3708
01:31:34,360 --> 01:31:36,430
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The Grand Duke of the North, Choi San)</font>

3709
01:31:34,390 --> 01:31:36,030
<font size="64">I would even bring you an empire.</font>

3710
01:31:36,730 --> 01:31:38,460
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The commanding presence and dignity...)</font>

3711
01:31:38,460 --> 01:31:40,900
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(of the original Grand Duke)</font>

3712
01:31:38,600 --> 01:31:41,030
<font size="64">- That's it! - That's the gaze.</font>

3713
01:31:41,000 --> 01:31:42,400
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Intimidated)</font>

3714
01:31:41,030 --> 01:31:42,570
<font size="64">This is it.</font>

3715
01:31:42,740 --> 01:31:46,310
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Beside him, the princess's dance bewitches the Grand Duke.)</font>

3716
01:31:42,800 --> 01:31:46,440
<font size="64">- This isn't so bad. - She's pretty good.</font>

3717
01:31:46,610 --> 01:31:49,640
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Beside him, the princess's dance bewitches the Grand Duke.)</font>

3718
01:31:46,640 --> 01:31:49,780
<font size="64">- I didn't recognize Ji Eun. - You look great with your haircut.</font>

3719
01:31:49,780 --> 01:31:50,980
<font size="64">Bon giorno.</font>

3720
01:31:52,310 --> 01:31:53,450
<font size="64">- Ji Eun. - I thought...</font>

3721
01:31:53,450 --> 01:31:54,810
<font size="64">you were doing an impression of Bobby Kim.</font>

3722
01:31:54,750 --> 01:31:56,150
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The princess's condition seems a bit off.)</font>

3723
01:31:54,910 --> 01:31:56,320
<font size="64">Bon giorno.</font>

3724
01:31:56,320 --> 01:31:58,080
<font size="64">You don't normally use a dialect, do you?</font>

3725
01:31:57,550 --> 01:32:00,090
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The rogue dukes catch a whiff and swarm in right away.)</font>

3726
01:31:58,080 --> 01:31:59,390
<font size="64">That's not true!</font>

3727
01:31:59,390 --> 01:32:01,090
<font size="64">His accent is fake.</font>

3728
01:32:00,990 --> 01:32:02,420
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Busted)</font>

3729
01:32:01,090 --> 01:32:02,490
<font size="64">How could you say that?</font>

3730
01:32:02,820 --> 01:32:05,390
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The kingdom is in a mess, overrun by swarming rebels.)</font>

3731
01:32:02,920 --> 01:32:04,660
<font size="64">I can't take this anymore. Move over.</font>

3732
01:32:04,660 --> 01:32:06,630
<font size="64">- One, two, three. - A tiger knows no fear of a "tier."</font>

3733
01:32:06,630 --> 01:32:08,160
<font size="64">You said tiger twice.</font>

3734
01:32:06,790 --> 01:32:08,060
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The princess is still out of it.)</font>

3735
01:32:08,160 --> 01:32:11,160
<font size="64">- You can do this. - Oh, no!</font>

3736
01:32:08,760 --> 01:32:11,130
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They must save the people who are suffering in agony.)</font>

3737
01:32:11,130 --> 01:32:12,730
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Flailing)</font>

3738
01:32:11,160 --> 01:32:12,730
<font size="64">- It's good, Ye Eun. - Oh, dear.</font>

3739
01:32:12,730 --> 01:32:15,700
<font size="64">- Go! Just go! - Good.</font>

3740
01:32:13,500 --> 01:32:16,040
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The only one they can trust is the Grand Duke of the North.)</font>

3741
01:32:15,900 --> 01:32:17,700
<font size="64">- Don't lose to Jong Kook. - He's so young.</font>

3742
01:32:16,040 --> 01:32:17,300
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Pulling out every last bit of his core strength)</font>

3743
01:32:17,340 --> 01:32:21,340
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(What's the fate of the kingdom on the Grand Duke's shoulders?)</font>

3744
01:32:17,700 --> 01:32:20,540
<font size="64">- Nice. - How is he so good?</font>

3745
01:32:20,540 --> 01:32:21,670
<font size="64">He's amazing.</font>

3746
01:32:21,670 --> 01:32:23,910
<font size="64">- Nice. - This isn't just right!</font>

3747
01:32:21,810 --> 01:32:24,410
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Grand Duke, There Is an Outsider Among Us.)</font>

3748
01:32:24,810 --> 01:32:30,550
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Running Man)</font>
